            "type": "richtext",
            "settings": {
              "content": {
                "en": "<h2>Does salmon sperm skincare work?</h2><p>Reviews of the injected route call the evidence promising but of low to moderate quality. The only controlled trial of a PDRN cream on intact skin is small and has no placebo side. The microneedling trial shows a faster result after a procedure, which a leave-on product cannot be assumed to share.</p><p>For the full appraisal of what the research shows, see our <a href=\"/pages/pdrn-research\">PDRN research</a> page. The table sets the three routes side by side:</p>"
              }
            }
          },
          "table": {
            "type": "liquid",
            "settings": {
              "liquid": {
                "en": "<style>.sgt .l{display:none}@media(max-width:699px){.sgt :is(tbody,tr,td){display:block}.sgt thead{display:none}.sgt tr{padding:8px 0;border-top:2px solid #3E4A52}.sgt td{border:0!important;padding:2px 0!important}.sgt .l{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#555}}</style><div class=\"sgt\"><table><thead><tr><th>Route</th><th>Who does it</th><th>Best human evidence</th><th>What it measured</th><th>What it does not show</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Injection (&ldquo;skin booster&rdquo;)</strong></td><td><span class=\"l\">Who does it</span>A medical practitioner</td><td><span class=\"l\">Best human evidence</span>Reviews of 7 trials (183 people) and 9 studies (219 patients), mostly injected (Alhussain 2026; Lampridou 2025)</td><td><span class=\"l\">What it measured</span>Called &ldquo;promising&rdquo;; the studies were &ldquo;of low and moderate quality&rdquo;</td><td><span class=\"l\">What it does not show</span>Anything about a product used at home</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Microneedling plus polynucleotide serum (clinic facial)</strong></td><td><span class=\"l\">Who does it</span>A clinic</td><td><span class=\"l\">Best human evidence</span><a href=\"/blogs/clinical-studies/pdrn-microneedling-split-face-trial-yogya-2022\">The microneedling trial</a> (Yogya 2022): 29 women, split face, 0.3% serum vs saline after radiofrequency microneedling</td><td><span class=\"l\">What it measured</span>Wrinkle indentation around the eyes improved significantly within 2 months on the serum side, and 6 months on the saline side</td><td><span class=\"l\">What it does not show</span>That the result transfers to a leave-on serum on intact skin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Leave-on cream at home</strong></td><td><span class=\"l\">Who does it</span>You</td><td><span class=\"l\">Best human evidence</span><a href=\"/blogs/clinical-studies/pdrn-vs-retinol-split-face-trial-ye-2026\">The 31-woman split-face trial</a> (Ye 2026): 0.1% PDRN eye cream vs 0.1% retinol, 28 days, no placebo</td><td><span class=\"l\">What it measured</span>Crow&rsquo;s-feet wrinkle area fell 23.0% on the PDRN side, against 6.6% with retinol: more than three times the improvement</td><td><span class=\"l\">What it does not show</span>A result for our product, or against a plain cream</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
