              },
              "content": {
                "en": "<p>In the Ye trial, eye-bag volume fell 14.8% on the PDRN side against 10.2% with retinol, under the same conditions as above. That is a larger fall, not double. The trial did not test a plain cream, so it cannot say how much of the change comes from PDRN rather than from moisturising.</p><p>The trial used an eye cream with PDRN as the only active. We have not tested our serum or cream ourselves, so we cannot say they will do the same. A cosmetic works on how skin looks and feels, and it does not replace a medical treatment.</p>"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "block_order": ["f1"],
