        "blocks": {
          "intro": {
            "type": "richtext",
            "settings": {
              "content": {
                "en": "<h2>Is salmon sperm skincare safe to use, and who should avoid it?</h2><p>In the Ye trial, no adverse reactions were reported on either side. The Yogya trial reported no infection, pigment change or scarring after the clinic procedure. Both are findings about the ingredient, in small groups, and neither tested our products.</p><p>Skip it or ask first if any of these apply:</p>"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "block_order": ["intro"],
