            "type": "richtext",
            "settings": {
              "content": {
                "en": "<p>Patch-test first on the inner forearm or behind the ear. No combination with other actives has been trialled, because in Ye the retinol was on the other half of the face. For injections, see a qualified medical practitioner.</p>"
              }
            }
          },
          "law": {
            "type": "richtext",
            "settings": {
              "content": {
                "en": "<h2>Is salmon sperm skincare legal?</h2><p>In August 2025, US dermatologists quoted by CNN and NBC Select said that injectable PDRN is not approved by the FDA and that topical products are sold as cosmetics. We report this as their view at that date. Rules differ by country and can change, so check your regulator&rsquo;s own pages for the current position.</p>"
              }
            }
          }
